            "review_title": "Review at Mudan Hotpot - Chinese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Destination Review by Daniel\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam307 contributions\n0\nVery happy with service & food\nDec 2019 • Family\n“forcibly” go to this hot pot restaurant for dinner. First impression is good design. \n\nThe second but most I like is attendant’s attitude. Highly value the way Ms. Y Nhi served our table. \n\nThe last but not least is food quality. All of them are fresh! We chose 4 types of soups. Meat and other stuff are all good. \n\nPrive look like reasonable.\n\nHighly recommend on the winter season.\nRead more\nWritten December 28, 2019",
