            "review_text": "Jay Nguyen\nDa Nang, Vietnam13 contributions\n0\nThe best hotpot restaurant in Danang\nAug 2019\nAt first, I thought it was a Haidilao wannabe but I was wrong. The hotpot tastes are different here. I really like their cheese hotpot. This place is great for families, they have kids' club for the little ones. Will come back soon.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 14, 2019",
